    <widget_type>Label</widget_type>
    <enabled>true</enabled>
    <text>"UNLOCKING" motor motion controls  :
*********************************
(need to be 2 persons)
power device for motor = ServoStar unit in LET8
When HIGH (LP+) or LOW (LN+) limit is reached
on ServoStar unit and no response from MaxV :
 - power OFF the  ServoStar unit
 - hold down the push button according to limit pos or neg
 - power ON  the ServoStar unit (still holding down button)
 - remote control command "MovAbs" to move from switch, 
   depending on direction pos or neg.
 - then Homing Procedure must be done to recover 
   coordinates.

Homing Procedure :
*****************
When switch "Home" is reached (green led lit) :
 - ReadBack value must be "0.0"
 - if not, press the "HOME rev" button to obtain 0.0
   (rev=reverse), sometimes have to be done twice!

NEVER use the "HOME rev" (or fwd) to reach the 
reference "0.0 mm", but just the simple command :
"MovAbs=0."

Must be done when Measurement is over :
**************************************
1) Ensure that :
     - "ReadBack" = 0.0mm
     - switch "HOME" reached (see motor user interface for more details)
 if not,  execute the command : "MovAbs" = 0.0mm
2) "DISABLE" the motor control devices to obtain red leds on MAXV and SERVO

- ServoStar unit can be POWERed OFF only when stages 1) and 2) are achieved.</text>
    <font>
      <opifont.name>Default</opifont.name>
    </font>
